# --- Media -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under public/media IS tracked, audio included.
#
# The original plan put the 58 MB of narration in R2 and kept it out of every
# clone and CI checkout. That is still the better end state, and the code is
# built for it — content stores origin-agnostic paths and src/lib/url.ts
# resolves them against PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE, so the move is one environment
# variable and no content edits.
#
# It is not the state today: R2 is not enabled on the Cloudflare account
# (API error 10042), enabling it needs a payment method, and the wrangler token
# carries no r2 scope. Rather than ship a repo whose every build fails a smoke
# test and whose narration 404s in production, the audio lives here. ~114 MB is
# well inside GitHub's limits and Cloudflare Pages' 25 MB-per-file cap.
#
# To move it to R2 later: enable R2, re-run `wrangler login`, `npm run
# media:push`, set PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE, then re-add the ignore line below.
# public/media/audio/
